    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trouble has  fallen upon King Joy and The Kingdom of Vrila. The Queen has gone missing and Shadows consume the land! A mysterious Dark Portal to the now corrupted Nature Realm has appeared in The Royal Garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into The Nature Realm which has now been consumed by dark memories and unravel the mystery behind the consuming Shadows and The Queens disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
